# Route: guide 39 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to 57, 65
# quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Redridge Mountains, Western Plaguelands, Stormwind City, Ironforge,
# Searing Gorge, Azshara, Un'Goro Crater): Three Corners -> Lakeshire -> Three
# Corners -> Sorrow Hill -> Felstone Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp ->
# Gahrron's Withering -> Sorrow Hill -> Thondroril River -> Lakeshire ->
# Lakeridge Highway -> Lakeshire -> Redridge Canyons -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Rise, Obsidion! (3566; Lathoric
# the Black 52, Obsidion 52).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): What Comes Around... (386), What Comes Around... (386),
# Songblade Search (95772), Songblade Search (95772), Barov Family Fortune
# (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald
# (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors
